  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the Third Water Supply and Sanitation for Low Income Communities Project (PAMSIMAS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Trust Fund Development Objectives of the proposed TF is  to  increase the number of low-income rural and peri-urban populations  accessing improved water and sanitation facilities and practicing  improved hygiene behaviors as part of the Recipient&apos;s efforts to  achieve WSS-MDGs, through programmatic mainstreaming and scaling-up of  a nationwide community-driven approach.</narrative>
  </description>
